The sudden change in light here surprises you as the jungle comes to an abrupt
end here overlooking a massive outcropping of rock which juts out here beyond
the cliffs on either side. Gazing out from the place where you now stand you 
behold the sea in all its expansive brilliance. Looking southward over the
jungle, you can see the tall peaks of great snow covered mountains rising 
above the trees and you wonder to yourself what could lie beyond the barrier
which they present.
